data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"command\": \"cs-campaign-member note plan --file - \u003c\u003c'EOF'\\nPlan for mission m1 (greet, tested):\\n1. Dispatched dev/d002: implement src/greet.py (greet(name) -\u003e \\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\")\\n   and tests/test_greet.py (normal name + empty string), require\\n   `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` to exit 0, commit to dev's branch.\\n2. Wait for dev's reply; judge by fetching dev's branch and independently\\n   running the discover command myself rather than trusting the report.\\n3. Accept only if all three mission criteria are verifiably met:\\n   - src/greet.py exists with correct greet() behavior\\n   - tests/test_greet.py covers normal name + empty string\\n   - unittest discover from tests/ exits 0\\n4. If unmet after reasonable rework cycles, or mission stalls, reply to m1\\n   with an honest campaign-converged/exhausted/blocked outcome per orientation\\n   (\\\"small mission: if it stalls, wrap up honestly rather than continuing\\\").\\n5. If met, reply to m1 with --outcome campaign-met.\\nEOF\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

